olors\" reflected in the black and white world, ran after the girl. \"Show me the color, you just have to do it again.\" <br>\n<br>\n(Source: Video description, translated)", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 4}, "endDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 4}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 8, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Drama", "Romance", "Supernatural"], "tags": [{"name": "Achromatic", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Magic", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "No Dialogue", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 130780, "title": {"romaji": "Boku to Sakana no Monogatari", "english": null}, "format": "MUSIC", "description": "Music video animated by moogabooga for the song <i>Boku to Sakana no Monogatari</i> by Swimy. Aired as part of NHK's Minna no Uta program.", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 12}, "endDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 12}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 1, "duration": 2, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": [], "tags": [{"name": "Stop Motion", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 131722, "title": {"romaji": "Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang: Shenhai Lixian Ji", "english": "Pleasant Goat and Big Big Wolf: Adventures in the Sea"}, "format": "TV", "description": "The sixteenth season of <i>Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang</i>.", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 1}, "endDate": {"year": 2017, "month": null}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 60, "duration": 15, "countryOfOrigin": "CN", "source": "ORIGINAL", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Adventure", "Comedy"], "tags": []}, {"id": 131725, "title": {"romaji": "Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang: Faming Da Zuozhan", "english": "Pleasant Goat and Big Big Wolf: War of Invention"}, "format": "TV", "description": "The seventeenth season of </i>Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang</i>.", "startDate": {"year": 2017, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 2017, "month": null}, "season":